Homepage: https://www.armbian.com

Package: network-manager-config-connectivity-armbian
Architecture: all
Depends: network-manager, ${misc:Depends}
Description: NetworkManager connectivity check for Armbian
 NetworkManager requests a URL every 5 minutes. A failed or redirected
 request shows a captive portal, for example hotel Wi-Fi, and the desktop
 opens the login page.
 .
 The file is 90-connectivity-armbian.conf. It overrides the Debian and
 Ubuntu connectivity configs, which use 20-.
